  "description": "Browser-based knowledge graph explorer for the MARCO-BOLO metadata catalog. Consumes the JSON-LD published by csv-to-json-ld and renders it as a filterable graph, with work package filtering, orphan detection for tasks and deliverables lacking recorded outputs, a coverage heatmap and GEXF export. Deployed at https://lab.marcobolo-project.eu/kg-explorer/. Forked from sdiggs/kg-explorer by Stephen C. Diggs.",
